/**
 * expect: no finding of its own. The scope root.
 * One JD-P01: r22 is a whole argument for what `goal`'s e_grid takes as given, so it grafts under
 * that leaf with refine(goal_base, r22) { hook: "e_grid" }.
 *
 * Two negatives are part of the case. The finding must name exactly one leaf, not all four: the
 * other three have nothing in this corpus that would prove them, and reporting them would be
 * speculation. And the flatness itself must not be reported: four bare leaves under one strategy is
 * jpipe-review's A03, decided from goal.jd alone. The comb is why P01 is worth ranking high, not a
 * finding of its own.
 */
load "goal.jd"
load "r22_grid.jd"

justification release is assemble(goal, r22) {
    conclusionLabel: "The release is fit to ship"
    strategyLabel:   "The identity checks and the release gates together cover the release"
}
